# SMARTvisuals

Resume: `@smartvisuals$` / `$smartvisuals$`. Official spellings (never translate): **SMARTvisuals**, **SMARTstencils**, **SMARTbackgrounds**, **SMARTview**, **SMARTpreview**, **SMARTnotification**. Protected brands: FloqR, Mingl, ShoutOut, BOT DEE / BOT-DEE, floqCast, VIP reserV.

## What it is

A **shared visual service**, not a Features & Services Search tile. Layers on `mingl` + `botDee`. Scenic art is **original FLOQR illustration**, not photography and not an official destination/Fashion Week/Burning Man mark. Packaged kit files are SVG. Studio Create/Edit for **SMARTbackgrounds** also accepts JPEG, PNG, and WebP drafts; **SMARTstencils** stay SVG (`currentColor`).

## Source of truth

| Surface | Truth |
|---|---|
| Published assets | git `smartvisuals/registry.json` + `catalog.json` + SVG files (26 stencils, 34 backgrounds) |
| Unpublished drafts | Firestore `smartVisualDrafts` (Master Admin read; Functions-write; sanitized `svgXml` or raster `imageBase64` + checksum so Review can preview; leftover `license` is optional and not required on submit) |
| Overrides / cache / ads / audit | `smartVisualOverrides`, `smartVisualSelections`, `smartVisualAdPolicy`, `smartVisualAuditLogs` |

Default-deny: unpublished / unsanitized assets never resolve for patrons.

## Resolver

`smartvisuals-resolver.js` (root ≡ `functions/`). Deterministic tags + aliases. **Gemini off** (`geminiAllowed() === false`) — do not call a model on card view. Private chat `sourceKind: private-chat` → no public SMARTnotification. Prompt injection / remote URLs → ignore + neutral `bg-mingl-room` + `st-people`. Collision (Seattle LA) → same neutral. Cancun Trip → travel + `st-flight` + `bg-bali` (kit has no cancun.svg).

## Surfaces

1. **Search SMARTnotification** — `index.html` `#smartvisualNotificationHost`. Compact glass card matching the original Cancun phone layout (header, thumbnail with title + TRAVEL/PLANNING chips, blurb, time, participants, cyan View Invitation / Not Now). Demo only: `?smartvisualInvite=cancun`. No fabricated live rooms for all patrons. Labeled Ad is **not** on this compact Search card.
2. **Room SMARTview** — overlay + BOT DEE card hero from `authorizedTitle` / `authorizedDescription` on the request payload (current utterance; never private thread). `botdee.html` loads `smartvisuals/catalog.json` via `ensureCatalog()`. Natural Cancun trip talk (Let’s plan our Cancun trip, Let’s plan a trip to Cancun, plan a Cancun trip, Cancun trip with friends) must mount the same card as **Open Room SMARTview Cancun Trip** (title Cancun Trip, travel tags, `bg-bali` + `st-flight`, mock Ad Travel partner / Fly to Cancun). Not live flight booking. Do not hijack nightlife-only asks (VIP tables tonight).
3. **Master Admin SMARTvisual Studio** — `#smartvisualStudio`. SOS2FA + `FLOQRReasonPrompt` to submit drafts **and** to publish queued drafts. Name is required. Rights / source is **not** a Create/Edit field (leftover `license` on old drafts is optional). Create/Edit `?` is `help-smartvisuals-create` (upload types). **Art upload** (not SVG-only): SMARTbackgrounds SVG/JPEG/PNG/WebP; SMARTstencils SVG. Server `sanitizeSmartVisualUpload` is the control — client `accept=` is UX only. **Review / Publish:** list `smartVisualDrafts`; select a row so Asset detail shows that file (not the old packaged illustration); **Publish** is visible after select (and on each queued row) — never hidden solely because SOS2FA is locked. `approveSmartVisualDraft` + reason; Studio overlays the matching registry id (Milan → `bg-milan`). Patrons still use git until Pages ships the file. Ads tab previews mock fill from `getSmartVisualAdPolicy` / `selectAd`. Library: tag filter. **Place SMARTview** on the right lists saved cards (click to edit) plus SMARTbackground / SMARTstencil / tags. Opening a library asset keeps that SMARTbackground selected. Published Review photos overlay the matching registry id and appear in the SMARTbackground list. Same-place kit duplicates collapse when a photo overlay exists. Save still `setSmartVisualOverride` (`placeSmartView:{kind}` or `placeSmartView:{placeId}`). Place-assign `?` is `help-smartvisuals-place-assign`. Preview `?` uses Create/Edit help so Milan (and every asset) is not an empty popout.
4. **Place SMARTview** — compact BOT DEE venue/place card (`botdee-smartview.js` `renderPlaceCard`, kinds venue / restaurant / hotel / event / travel / …). Fixed template: kind + name, 2-line blurb, ratings, public-page CTA, 28px chrome, 28px SMARTstencil, tag chips. Background is a published SMARTbackground (`resolvePlaceCard`); explicit `smartStencilId` / `smartTags` win when stamped. Not a photo well and not empty black. Distinct from People, Room, and Features SMARTview.
5. **Headless SMARTview** — public `botdee-smartview-headless.html` (`data-floqr-public`). `?mode=headless&q=` (or `?mode=interactive` paste box) turns authorized text into the same compact Place/info cards. Optional `?tag=` filters by assigned tags. `cardsFromAuthorizedText` in `botdee-smartview-headless.js`. No Search, no Features catalog, no `executeBotSession`, no sign-in. Gemini off. Display boards unchanged. SPAAVS sample cards stay removed.

Join Now uses `FLOQRNav` (no `?v=`). Display URLs unchanged.

## Ads / headless

Labeled slot below Room SMARTview (BOT DEE + preview). Compact Search SMARTnotification has no Ad. Fill is a **mock sample** from authorized title / description / SMARTstencils / SMARTbackgrounds tags via `resolver.selectAd` + `getSmartVisualAdPolicy` (`mockFill: true`, `adsEnabled: false`). Cancun Trip → Travel partner / Fly to Cancun; Paris Fashion Week → fashion; dining → restaurant; generic room → Mingl Room (no destination). Empty only for private chat or prompt injection. Never invent a real advertiser or live inventory. AdSense **never loaded**. Visual classification must **not** invoke headless partner tools.

